WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Cheap-Drive: Move cars, Win margins.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:12.800
Prototype. Test. Loop. Repeat. 1,685 testing runs, 5 models, and 1.5B tokens burned across Alpha, Beta, Gamma, and Delta.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:19.800
Beta: filter requests, price for dealer trust, raise gig fees after pickup opens, and meet the 90% on-time gate.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.800
Find what broke: inspect dealer notes, pickup windows, and late delivery outcomes in the live week analysis report.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:32.800
Gamma: higher margin (+€830/wk), but one week missed the gate at 89.96% on time in the first eight-week holdout.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:39.800
Gamma: read dealer notes and combine cars in one gig, adding +€2,031 per week vs Beta across 8 new practice weeks.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:45.800
Delta in production: +€1,664 per week vs Early Delta across 19 ranked practice weeks, and €75,764 across 5 ranked Round 9 weeks.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:51.800
Delta: Quantity > the best margins. Wider windows, overdue rescue, 90 km pairing, and a 42% win target lift volume from 257 to 342 orders per week.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:59.800
More runs cleared the ranking gate across 1,685 practice runs: from 84.6% ranked in Alpha to 98.6% ranked in Delta.
